###
# Prism Backend API Tests
# Use VS Code REST Client extension to run these
# NOW WITH COMPLETE CRUD! ✅
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### ==================== USERS (COMPLETE CRUD) ====================

### Create User
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tim@example.com"
}

### Get All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/users

### Get User by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/1

### Update User ✨ NEW
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "tim.updated@example.com"
}

### Delete User ✨ NEW (WARNING: CASCADE DELETES ARTICLES & RESULTS!)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/2

### ==================== ARTICLES (COMPLETE CRUD) ====================

### Create Article (Manual)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/article",
  "content": "Sample article content...",
  "userId": 1
}

### Get All Articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles

### Get Article by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/1

### Update Article
PUT {{baseUrl}}/articles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/updated-article",
  "content": "Updated content..."
}

### Delete Article
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/articles/1

### ==================== RESULTS (COMPLETE CRUD) ====================

### Create Analysis Result (Manual)
POST {{baseUrl}}/articles/1/results
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biasScore": 75,
  "biasedLeaning": "left",
  "summary": "Test summary of bias analysis"
}

### Get Result by Article ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/articles/1/results

### Update Result
PUT {{baseUrl}}/results/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biasScore": 80,
  "biasedLeaning": "right",
  "summary": "Updated summary"
}

### Delete Result ✨ NEW
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/results/1

### ==================== ANALYSIS (AUTO-SAVES TO DB!) ====================

### ⚡ Analyze Article - Basic (auto-saves!)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze-article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news"
}

### Analyze Article - With User ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze-article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world",
  "userId": 1
}

### Analyze Article - Skip Cache (force new analysis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze-article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news",
  "skipCache": true
}

### ==================== HISTORY & STATS ====================

### Get Analysis History (last 20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history

### Get Analysis History (last 10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?limit=10

### Get Analysis History (for specific user)
GET {{baseUrl}}/history?userId=1

### Get Single Analysis by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/history/1

### Get System Statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/stats

### ==================== COMPLETE CRUD WORKFLOW ====================

### 1️⃣ Create a user
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "workflow@test.com"
}

### 2️⃣ Update the user (use ID from step 1)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/users/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "workflow.updated@test.com"
}

### 3️⃣ Analyze an article for this user
POST {{baseUrl}}/analyze-article
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "url": "https://www.bbc.com/news",
  "userId": 3
}

### 4️⃣ Get user with all articles
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/3

### 5️⃣ Update the analysis result (use ID from response)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/results/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "biasScore": 90,
  "biasedLeaning": "left",
  "summary": "Updated: Very biased analysis"
}

### 6️⃣ Delete the result
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/results/1

### 7️⃣ Delete the article
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/articles/1

### 8️⃣ Delete the user (CASCADE!)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/users/3
